  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220881_Project Salam+</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a small opportunity that FCDO has awarded to WV Mauritania. After approval, FCDO asked WVUK to sign the contract. 
 
 The proejct aims to improve awareness and promote positive life choices to reduce the risk of youth becoming victims of extremism. 
 
 Objectives: 
 
 - To empower youth and women with economic livelihoods 
 
 - To improve awareness among youth and women on radicalization and violent extremism.
 
 The project&apos;s duration is 45 days.</narrative>
  </description>
